><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">I don't know. In the kitchen?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Non, il n'est pas dans la cuisine.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">No, he isn't in the kitchen.</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Dans la chambre ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">In the bedroom?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Oui ! Il est dans la chambre !</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Yes! He's in the bedroom!</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Il est de quelle couleur ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">What colour is he?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Il est noir.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">He is black.</span></p>","recordPrompt":null,"expectedText":null,"size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793234577,"_nanoseconds":915000000}},{"id":"OcfnxLSSfjyHig63OLYq","level":"a0-les-petits","lesson":14,"part":8,"type":"text","name":"ab-kids-l14-p08-b1","partTitle":"Your turn 1/5","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"margin:6px 0;\">🧑‍🏫 <b>Salut ! Ça va ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Hi! How are you?</span></p><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b style=\"font-size:1.3rem;\">Ça va bien !</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">I'm good!</span></p>","recordPrompt":"Your turn! Say your line.","expectedText":"Ça va bien !","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793234577,"_nanoseconds":858000000}},{"id":"zHbwPOZmJJ69sWEBIFv8","level":"a0-les-petits","lesson":14,"part":9,"